    "title": "Incredible Sprunki Music Box",
    "description": "Horror Sprunk in Music Box is a friday thrilling musical rhythm game that combines creativity with a spooky twist! Let your musical imagination soar as you dive into a funny music battles!\r\n\r\nThis night Boyfriend will only get to rap battle Wenda who might be one of the characters causing the scary things to happen. Gray is like the main character for horror mode which is why they're both here. Dance through horror night to save yourself! Will BF be defeated or will he save GF in danger? Let's see!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies, climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Easy to play online/ offline\r\n- Full mods all horror characters as you expected (Silly Billy, Twiddle finger)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Not require starting a new mode of play\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow us on social media for any issue!",
